          "type": "doc",
          "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "3. Canonical word alignment cascade\nRaw Whisper words: trim; invalid End becomes Start\nNormalize: strip tashkeel/marks, tatweel, punctuation, symbols; lowercase\nA. Unit LCS: accept >= 25% units OR >= 2 matches\nB. Forward normalized scan: every canonical word found in order\nC. Word LCS: accept >= 45% canonical words\nD. Same-length positional fallback: >= 50% positional matches\nMatched canonical words receive Whisper time; missing words are interpolated\nIf all fail, retain initial even timing" }] }]
        }
      }
